BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Release credit and capacity in measured increments. A $30,000 unrestricted reserve with a $10,000 liquidity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (cushion supports no more than $20,000 of otherwise unfunded carrier commitments under this simple) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (exposure rule. At $2,000 per load, that is ten loads, not twenty merely because the shipper promises repeat) Tj ET
