BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (customer payments replenish capacity only when available to spend. Set customer limits using all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (outstanding exposure, including delivered but unbilled freight and accepted tenders. Concentration matters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (because ten loads for one debtor are not ten independent credit risks. Review aging daily during the pilot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (and immediately stop additional unsecured commitments when an agreed threshold is breached. Use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (cleared deposits, shorter payment terms, or a properly reviewed funding facility to reopen capacity. Never) Tj ET
